        {
          "exampleId": "w:reject#e-6461d03732b2987c",
          "text": "When contributions were made by geniuses outside the club – women, or people of a different color or belief – they were unacknowledged and rejected by others.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2021-national-a",
            "paperTitle": "2021年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（全国甲卷）",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2021-national-a:reading-d",
