            "start": 139,
            "end": 147
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:reject#e-1ec6a12aaf97273e",
          "text": "In my ninth-grade writing class last year, I met a cowboy who saved his town, a strict father who demanded his son earn straight A’s, and a modern-day Juliet who died of heartbreak after her parents rejected the love of her young life.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2025-i",
            "paperTitle": "2025年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新课标Ⅰ）英语试题",
            "groupId": "group:paper-gaokao-2025-i:reading-b",
            "locator": {
