            "end": 115
          }
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:reject#e-8d478876a8fc902d",
          "text": "Things like kale ribs, fish collars, rejected sweet potatoes, and cucumber butts were all re-appropriated and, with the help of a number of good chefs, turned into excellent cuisine.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2025-ii",
            "paperTitle": "2025年普通高等学校招生全国统一考试（新课标Ⅱ）英语试题",
